*.blend1

# Learning material and build output, kept local only:
# copyrighted books and compiled binaries do not belong in a public repo.
C++/

# Generated output. The small previews next to each README are committed on
# purpose; full-resolution renders and trained weights ship as release assets.
out/
checkpoints/
*.pt
*.pth

# Result tables are the exception and are committed. A number typed into a
# README has to have a file behind it that CI can read back, which is what
# check_quoted_numbers.py does with these. Logs stay out: they carry absolute
# paths from whichever machine trained the run.
**/results/*
!**/results/*.csv
